  "content": "<h1>联动蛙光体</h1><p>联动蛙光体是一款资源包，为所有蛙光体变种、菌光体和海晶灯添加了无缝纹理支持！</p><p>需要安装：Continuity<br>未测试与Optifine的兼容性。</p><h1>截图展示</h1><h2>珍珠蛙光体</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/effe41c5c0698a2c83f9c228b686ef2b1536efcb.png\" alt=\"珍珠蛙光体\"></p><h2>翠绿蛙光体</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b21515c11d36f16f89c0ee09fe2f1e3b533844d.png\" alt=\"翠绿蛙光体\"></p><h2>赭色蛙光体</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e03c8528443ae796f24d570450358cf8ed57c74a.png\" alt=\"赭色蛙光体\"></p>",
